-names>JS</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Viral hijacking of G-protein-coupled-receptor signalling networks</article-title><source>Nature Reviews Molecular Cell Biology</source><year>2004</year><volume>5</volume><fpage>998</fpage><lpage>1012</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15573137</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1038/nrm1529</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B5"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Dampier</surname><given-names>W</given-names></name><name><surname>Tozeren</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Signaling perturbations induced by invading H. pylori proteins in the host epithelial cells: A mathematical modeling approach</article-title><source>Journal of Theoretical Biology</source><year>2007</year><volume>248</volume><fpage>130</fpage><lpage>144</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">17559886</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1016/j.jtbi.2007.03.014</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B6"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Brass</surname><given-names>AL</given-names></name><name><surname>Dykxhoorn</surname><given-names>DM</given-names></name><name><surname>Benita</surname><given-names>Y</given-names></name><name><surname>Yan</surname><given-names>N</given-names></name><name><surname>Engelman</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Xavier</surname><given-names>RJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Lieberman</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Elledge</surname><given-names>SJ</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Identification of Host Proteins Required for HIV Infection Through a Functional Genomic Screen</article-title><source>Science</source><year>2008</year><volume>319</volume><fpage>921</fpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">18187620</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1126/science.1152725</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B7"><citation c